9726-library-new-request-org.springframework.boot-spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test-4.1.1-65806faf.\n\nThe most likely failing stage is `setup/run_workflow_engine()` during exploration iteration 4: the generated test suite did not converge. The latest Gradle attempt fails on the JVM because `AutoConfigureMetricsIntegrationTest.annotationAllowsAnEnabledSimpleRegistryToRecordMetrics()` expects a `MeterRegistry`, but the constructed Spring context contains no such bean. Earlier attempts also showed a JUnit API mismatch (`ExtensionContext.Store.computeIfAbsent` `NoSuchMethodError`) and a native-only `ClassNotFoundException` for `MetricsContextCustomizerFactory`.\n\nDynamic-access coverage is unavailable because `generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport` found no `build/native/nativeTestCompile/dynamic-access` input and failed rather than emitting an empty report. No run metrics were produced.\n\nRelevant logs:\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/add-new-library-support/pi-generation-2026-10-07T12-47-30-270844Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T13-19-06-867544Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T13-03-29-490875Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-07T12-47-14-267780Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Correct the generated Spring test setup and dependencies so `@AutoConfigureMetrics` is processed through an appropriate Boot test context and produces a usable `MeterRegistry`.\n2. Run the coordinate’s JVM and native tests, resolving both the JUnit compatibility issue and native `MetricsContextCustomizerFactory` reachability failure.\n3. Regenerate the dynamic-access coverage report, then review and finalize the resulting metadata.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08497748619bde